Bjolang REPL. :help for commands, Ctrl-D to leave.
apple-count
apple-count	entry 1
random-int	(std random)
r/random-bool	(std random)
r/random-bytes!	(std random)
:show	command
let/mono	special form
xylophone	this entry
random	module
std	module
string-length	(std prelude)
sqrt	(std prelude)
Num	(std maths)
even?	(std maths)
even?: function from (std maths)
  (even? x)
  : (-> %a bool)
  Whether a number is an even integer.
  x        The number. A double counts when it is whole.
  returns  #t when x is an integer divisible by 2. 2.5 is neither even nor odd.
  See also: odd?, modulo
